# JALADHAR credentials — copy to .env, fill in, and `chmod 600 .env`
# .env is gitignored and has never been committed. Keep it that way.
# Never echo these into logs, transcripts, or agent reports.

# NASA Earthdata — GPM IMERG historical granules (src/jaladhar/forcing/fetch_imerg.py)
